      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "recto, Col. I, left",
          "value": "\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">\nCr. to my lord the elder Ab\u016b Sahl, the Son of the Kohen\u2014may God\n</li>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\">\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0make his honored position permanent</p>\n\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nThe price of all he left in 6 purses  68 \u2153 \u00bc (d)\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nThe price of 94\u00bd golden silver pieces  5\u2154 d.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nThe price of 103 brought by Ab\u016b \u02bfAl\u012b\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nof which I have received the price of 65 dirhams, namely, 4d.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nThe balance to the debit of Ab\u016b \u02bfAl\u012b 38 dirh.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nTo his debit also    200 dirh.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nSame, first payment through his paternal uncle 200 dirh.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nSame, balance of    272 dirh.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nTotal weight 869\u00bd\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nDebit on Ab\u016b \u02bfAl\u012b through Ibn al-Sukkar\u012b 17 dirh. for 1d., 1d.\n</li>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\">(one line left free)</p>\n<p></p>\n\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nCr. price of the pawns deposited by the Preacher 18\u2153d.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nCr. balance of payment for two pots of \u02bfAl\u012b 7\u2153d.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nCr. price of 438 silver dirh., after the loss of two dirh., which had\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nfallen off. Price 17 dirh. per dinar  25 \u00bd \u00bc d.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nCr. (Torn away)     ..\u2154 (d.) 3q\n</li></ol>\n",
          "format": "text/html"
        }
      ],
      "motivation": [
        "sc:supplementing",
        "translating"
      ],
      "schema:position": 1
    },
