          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "recto, Col. IV, right",
          "value": "\n<ol><li dir=\"ltr\">\nDr. for the poor for the poll tax    1d.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<del>Dr. price of two cloaks for Umm Ab\u012b\u2026  1\u00bdd.</del>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n<del>Dr. for the rent of a store room    1d.</del>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nDr. for two sacks of wheat and their transport  2d. less \u2153\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nDr. for 3 loads of hazelnuts in the house of al-An\u1e63\u0101r\u012b 34d.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0and for the \u201cboys\u201d (officials)    6 dirh.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\ncommission and weigher ((included in)) in addition to the price\n</li>\n\n<p dir=\"ltr\">\u00bd \u215b (d.)</p>\n\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nrose-water and (Chinese) rhubarb   ((\u00bc \u215b))\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a05\u00bdq.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nDr. after his arrival through my master Ab\u016b \u02bfImr\u0101n\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nPurse of the House of Blessing    50d.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nPurse of Ibn Muhadhdhib al-Dawla   38 less 1\u00bd q.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nPurse of the Treasury     15\u2153 \u00bc\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Total 103\u00bd (d.) 1\u00bdq.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nPurse of Hiba al-Khashaba    51\u00bd\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0Total 155 (d.) 1\u00bdq.\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nDr. handed over to him purse of \u2026 (torn away)\n</li>\n<li dir=\"ltr\">\nDr. balance from the price of the hazelnut \u2026 ( )\n</li></ol>\n\n<p>\u00a0</p>",
